BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kasos-fry-panigiri-of-agios-spyridon-fry-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271213
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Spyridon\, Fry
LOCATION:Fry\, Kasos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The port town's own winter panigiri\, on 11-12 December at the church of Agios Spyridon in Fry\, with vespers and a glendi indoors with lyra\, sweets and wine. One of the few times to see Kasos with only Kasiots on it.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kasos/#fry-panigiri-of-agios-spyridon-fry
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kasos/#fry-panigiri-of-agios-spyridon-fry
END:VEVENT
